ady formatted in bold) already clearly explains the situation. In combination with \"obvious\" the text flow takes on a jeering/shaming character.\n\nI don't see that as needless, it emphasizes the underlying issue and if rebuilding the whole map every time is not obviously inefficient I don't know what is. I had ChatGPT reformulate it non the less.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2560088830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2560120299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100759#issuecomment-2560120299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100759","id":2560120299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YmFXr","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-23T18:13:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-23T18:15:06Z","body":"Na it is ok. I even appreciated the meme. Everyone can chill.\n\nWe have older issues open for the same thing like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68642 and we have proposals like https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5635 for the actual implementation details all tracking more or less the same stuff. Those are also linked in the navigation tracker https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/73566.\n\nI think with those links it should be clearer why that issue was closed. I would appreciate if you could add your implementation details and suggestions to that proposal that would be a good place for this so contributors can find those info when they might start working on that stuff.\n\nThe reason why I linked that PR to close the issues is because it solved the immediate problem while what is left was either a duplicate already coved by other issues and proposals or too generic and open ended in the \"make things faster\" ballpark which I agree but that is not what issues are kept for. So even if the PR would have not closed the issue directly it would have been closed on the next clean up wave as an issue duplicate or consolidated because a proposal tracked the problem or feature already. \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2560120299/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2560899489","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100759#issuecomment-2560899489","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100759","id":2560899489,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YpDmh","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Z